  "notes": [
    "ModuleProxyFactory 0x000000000000addb49795b0f9ba5bc298cdda236 CREATE2-created the 45-byte EIP-1167 clone 0x363d3d373d3d3d363d734a97e65188a950dd4b0f21f9b5434daee0bbf9f55af43d82803e903d91602b57fd5bf3, which hardcodes the Delay mastercopy, and in the same transaction set it up for card Safe 0x915e683649ab7743f8145d0536cf5168959c9159 and enabled owner Safe 0x7f59e536f083a63b67adfe3bc793a47744dba7d8 as its only module (EnabledModule, log 54). That enabled contract module is the signer the forgery impersonates, so this creation both activated the code for this context and set the configuration the exploit needed; the clone emitted no module, owner or avatar change before the exploit.",
    "The canonical figure is the Gnosis Pay post-mortem's per-asset total taken by the attacker(s), USD 1,496,151 (GNO 641,159; EURe 453,175; USDC.e 399,121; SAFE 2,202; WETH 323; xDAI 135; USDC 28; USDT 7), excluding a further ~USD 300k it reports as rendered inaccessible; Gnosis later restored users, which does not reduce gross loss. The components are an exact onchain lower bound for the primary attacker EOA 0x81ba8a2b895d30280bca199c2ff75f3f058d4c6c only: Transfer logs crediting it in the 102 Delay.executeNextTx transactions of source-6 (82 sent by the EOA, 20 by its executor 0xf6a9f265012130d02fda1f39f74e9faf8388d2f6), each debiting a different card Safe behind a clone of Delay 0x4a97e65188a950dd4b0f21f9b5434daee0bbf9f5, total USD 541,172.81. EURe is counted once although the legacy wrapper 0xcb444e90d8198415266c6a2724b7900fb12fc56e mirrors each 0x420ca0f9 Transfer; two LI.FI USDC.e returns to the EOA (0x0f44354b..., 0x06191310...) are excluded. Other addresses that used the same forgery, including rescuers such as Safe 0xbb897a566146fdb959ddde80ce00c50b4f5be03f, are not attributed here.",
    "The USD total is the post-mortem's reported attacker take; onchain reconstruction covers only the 102 drains credited to 0x81ba8a2b895d30280bca199c2ff75f3f058d4c6c (USD 541,172.81), because many unrelated addresses, rescuers included, queued forged Delay transactions in parallel and the post-mortem does not list which it counts as attackers.",
    "realizedAt is the last verified drain to 0x81ba8a2b895d30280bca199c2ff75f3f058d4c6c; drains by other attacker addresses may have ended later."
  ]
